  "webAdapter": "Interpolate the visible blade between its right palm and a seated transform derived from original DES blade/sheath axes and tip endpoints, during original POS phases. The source R/L control tracks are unchanged. Exact native compensation/loading remains unverified.",
  "acceptanceCorrection": "The legacy all-frame palm constraint was wrong for a sheathed blade. Tests now check the actual blade tip/edge inside visible sheath bounds, hilt outside, no model hiding, partial travel, public commands from both stances, drawing/return and four variants.",
  "passiveBodyDamage": "Full regression exposed a pre-existing zero-damage assertion. Diagnostic records showed player reactions104/105/103 causing body hits, with no player move commands. Original POS102-106/111 contain body attack windows. Acceptance now allows only these source reaction windows and verifies damage accounting; runtime damage rules were unchanged.",
  "nativeExploration": "Read-only exports of qiankun ctor, pose sets and loader membership queries retained. Their full native rendering semantics were not assumed as a blade-hiding rule.",
